  Slug: pelt-of-the-beast
  DisplayName: Pelt of the Beast
  IconPath: icons/equipment/back/cloak-fur-brown.webp
  Description: "Usage worn cloak or belt This animal hide, whether worn about the
    shoulders or waist, is all you need to survive even the harshest elements. When
    you make your daily preparations, choose cold, electricity, fire, poison, or
    sonic damage. The pelt attunes to that damage type. Immanence You gain resistance
    equal to half your level to the damage type the pelt is attuned to. You also
    treat environmental cold and heat effects as one step less severe. Transcendence\u2014
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Survive the Wilds] 1 (aura, manipulate,
    transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.NdMSHDtV9G7MbdP2 inline]"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
  SourcePack: classfeatures
